# autotest alpha.10 batch G (lane SC2, 2026-11-24). Written against the Feature text with sha e6ef5035b7f65825; honest subset only: what a screen or the guest shows is under clause, everything else under not-covered.
row: F-SET-07
targets: qemu
profile: ram
feature-sha: e6ef5035b7f65825
doc: Settings, Network, Share internet shows the two lists to choose from (read only)
clause: 1 Settings, Network, key i shows the two lists, where the internet comes from and Share it through
not-covered: a click or a touch on a row of either list
not-covered: the row height for a finger
